# Env and Supabase

- Parse env only via `lib/env.ts` (Zod)
- Public: `NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL`, `NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY`
- Server-only: `SUPABASE_SECRET_KEY`, `ADMIN_*`, R2 credentials
- Publishable client for public reads (RLS enforced)
- Secret client only after admin session verification
- Never log secrets or put them in error messages
